{"name":"factions_autonz_hub","seed":65}
# The autonz as a settlement (autonz_plan.md, phase E3): New Expedition seed
# 65 with Rival factions 4, 120 days on (debug days): Leaden Ridge (sys_5)
# holds an autonz hub that knows its relay and seeker patterns by Tier 1's
# assimilation walk. Jump there, beam one down, set the autonz neutral (so
# its enforcers stay off the landing party) and land: the hub materialises
# with its Signal Core on the red core, the cogitator and a relay pylon on
# the wire's edge, its prints by type (wire placers, enforcers, relay drones,
# seekers). Frames: the hub (the core and cogitator), the hub a day on, and
# the Factions tab's autonz row (units by type, structures).
